# unit_objects_09: the course objects' handlers of bank $09 that no play
# reaches (or not on every path), as calls on object 1 ($2001) from a Novice
# race's state: each set-up with and without a free object ($0CEE = $2E),
# each frame handler on its paths (the score gate with a record staged in
# Super FX RAM at $70:5000 whose contact list reports a hit, and without);
# the flying piece's release after a failed record (09:8E0A, entered
# directly: the record pools are not staged); the firework shells, sparks
# and the finish gate's fireworks; the bumper, switch, platform, gate
# posts, sky ball and dropped ball (contact lists staged at $70:5000).
